{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2OAoGOvysScieVhIazrWTXj2ESp.jpg","created_by":[{"id":1214616,"credit_id":"54306d9ec3a36831b200142e","name":"Julie Plec","original_name":"Julie Plec","gender":1,"profile_path":"/kQeuOgZBKDs80W4Ssm91x6zAdWu.jpg"}],"episode_run_time":[45,42],"first_air_date":"2013-10-03","genres":[{"id":10765,"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy"},{"id":18,"name":"Drama"},{"id":9648,"name":"Mystery"}],"homepage":"http://www.cwtv.com/shows/the-originals","id":46896,"in_production":false,"languages":["en"],"last_air_date":"2018-08-01","last_episode_to_air":{"id":1524547,"name":"When the Saints Go Marching In","overview":"Intent on saving Hope's life, Klaus' plan will change the lives of the Mikaelson family forever.","vote_average":9.1,"vote_count":12,"air_date":"2018-08-01","episode_number":13,"episode_type":"finale","production_code":"#513","runtime":42,"season_number":5,"show_id":46896,"still_path":"/jWuQBupM4JPXpnPsBYGnWjHdoNl.jpg"},"name":"The Originals","next_episode_to_air":null,"networks":[{"id":71,"logo_path":"/hEpcdJ4O6eitG9ADSnDXNUrlovS.png","name":"The CW","origin_country":"US"}],"number_of_episodes":92,"number_of_seasons":5,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Originals","overview":"The Vampire Diaries spin-off that follows the Mikaelsons, a family of millennia-old, power-hungry vampires who want to reclaim the city they built, New Orleans, and dominate all those who have wronged them.","popularity":23.3248,"poster_path":"/keJOhJXGiLL54EW6QocbyvQGquA.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":34536,"logo_path":null,"name":"My So-Called Company","origin_country":"US"},{"id":10067,"logo_path":"/p1kZoVNfkVvk7xyJZEposRxcfh8.png","name":"Alloy Entertainment","origin_country":"US"},{"id":1081,"logo_path":"/19kn4jVvpc3sAL3YpZNb3elhSMl.png","name":"CBS Studios","origin_country":"US"},{"id":1957,"logo_path":"/pJJw98MtNFC9cHn3o15G7vaUnnX.png","name":"Warner Bros. Television","origin_country":"US"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"seasons":[{"air_date":null,"episode_count":28,"id":55057,"name":"Specials","overview":"","poster_path":"/qzx2ijkjfDwB3PxAzoxHLceSgN5.jpg","season_number":0,"vote_average":0.0},{"air_date":"2013-10-03","episode_count":22,"id":55058,"name":"Season 1","overview":"Family is power. The Original Vampire family swore it to each other a thousand years ago. They pledged to remain together, always and forever. Now, centuries have passed and the bonds of family are broken. Time, tragedy and hunger for power have torn the Original Family apart. When Klaus Mikaelson, the original vampire-werewolf hybrid, receives a mysterious tip that a plot is brewing against him in the supernatural melting pot that is the French Quarter of New Orleans, he returns to the city his family helped build. Klaus’ questions lead him to a reunion with his diabolical former protégé, Marcel, a charismatic vampire who has total control over the human and supernatural inhabitants of New Orleans.","poster_path":"/8It4Yk8S4nBAbxCY2D6nDbpJ9uM.jpg","season_number":1,"vote_average":7.9},{"air_date":"2014-10-06","episode_count":22,"id":62091,"name":"Season 2","overview":"In season two, a new status quo must be adjusted to, as the newly empowered werewolves control the city. Plus, Klaus struggles with weaknesses and Elijah fights to save Hayley — now a hybrid — from a vicious spiral of self-destruction.","poster_path":"/zShOqH7rO5SKrYzzyJY4t66sXnr.jpg","season_number":2,"vote_average":8.2},{"air_date":"2015-10-08","episode_count":22,"id":67993,"name":"Season 3","overview":"Season three finds Klaus and Elijah estranged from each other, even as both brothers adjust to life with their long-lost sister, Freya. Hayley suffers mightily at the hands of Klaus’s petty vengeance, while Marcel and Davina rule the city under a new status quo. Meanwhile, Cami and Vincent find themselves caught up in a surprising mystery involving the newest resident of New Orleans.","poster_path":"/9Q9FXHuO87H0Y0jeds1CFI1DTbh.jpg","season_number":3,"vote_average":8.1},{"air_date":"2017-03-16","episode_count":13,"id":82407,"name":"Season 4","overview":"When a dark prophecy threatens their immortal lives, the Mikaelson family faces their greatest challenge yet. After centuries of fighting to preserve their family, Klaus Mikaelson and his brother Elijah’s ruthless actions have spawned a legion of enemies. Surrounded by these enemies, the Mikaelsons enact a brutal strategy that will turn everyone against them, thus setting the course for season four.","poster_path":"/pp5UAm0ieK2irqcDbt2I6Kirmaf.jpg","season_number":4,"vote_average":7.9},{"air_date":"2018-04-18","episode_count":13,"id":101550,"name":"Season 5","overview":"The age old Mikaelson family has spent centuries fighting against legions of enemies. The original vampires have strived since the beginning of time to protect their family, no matter what the cost. The fifth and final season is no different as the Mikaelsons must once again count on the strength of their unbreakable family bond even after swearing to stay away from each other for good.","poster_path":"/5mx5MYSzTcAHdATNJSAVa959Nr9.jpg","season_number":5,"vote_average":8.0}],"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Ended","tagline":"Always and forever.","type":"Scripted","vote_average":8.594,"vote_count":3495,"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":79505,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Joseph Morgan","original_name":"Joseph Morgan","popularity":2.6194,"profile_path":"/iNNHzvT3glx11njLD3RL4yOYPbJ.jpg","character":"Klaus Mikaelson","credit_id":"54306b4f0e0a26464000142d","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":19154,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Daniel Gillies","original_name":"Daniel Gillies","popularity":2.4767,"profile_path":"/zasTOfb8TNyVGwRfb4jNdHnsZ2m.jpg","character":"Elijah Mikaelson","credit_id":"54306b750e0a264643001341","order":1},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1257